{"overview":"In the small village of Nuottaniemi live Iisakki and his daughter Hanna. Iisakki bears a grudge against Heikki, blaming him for the death of his son in a timber rafting accident. To make things worse, Heikki's son Juhani wants to marry Hanna but she only has eyes for the lumberjack Antti.","tagline":"","cast":[{"n":"Konrad Tallroth","c":"Iisakki","p":"/a2A9cJDb0K9DhWFvvzfN1iGdGHa.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Heidi Blåfield","c":"Hanna","p":"/jC1PvdYR3J8Apya45Lk7S4lVWIq.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Jaakko Korhonen","c":"Heikki","p":"/2LbzKR4JKb7taBMcuZ8GzTW1LsZ.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Einar Rinne","c":"Juhani","p":"/AvqvhDnrCpk617mLupzGU8aVq5M.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Oiva Soini","c":"Antti Koskenalusta","p":"/1srj3rAOEnrLVG1i3w1DUkr9eb7.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Aku Käyhkö","c":"Kero-Pieti","p":"/cTSYvXKJxI40FDYY0KctrY9qEnK.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Kirsti Suonio","c":"Anna","p":"/kIJh4ybRsaNLA2yptbixUVfXHPO.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Joel Rinne","c":"Log Driver","p":"/hhJ7LIDhlaOlw888QogIF7kla8Z.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Emil Mikkola","c":"Log Driver on the Ferry (uncredited)","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Eero Leväluoma","c":"Log Driver (uncredited)","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["Finland"],"language":["Finnish"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Rapids-Rider%27s_Brides_(1923_film)","qid":"Q11872744"}